  "text": "Vertigo, foggy head, clearing throat, sleepless leg, stroke like symptons slurred speech blending words, stiff neck back and arm pain, diagnosis with swollen pancrease, chest pains, restless sleep, sexual staminia declined.\nI just started tests for a swollen pancrease and chest pain.\nI thought I was losing my mind.\nWent off the nexium in 1 day felt better (head stuff), still have pain in back and arm, off for 10 days now.\nHave not felt this good in 3 years.\nI am embarrassed to have not associated these symptons to nexium use.\nJust thought was middle aged stuff.\nAll I read and was told is that Nexium caused dizziness.\n",
